# 301 permanent redirects: old domain → new domain.
# Hostname-scoped (absolute URL form), so these only fire on the orphan
# Netlify site that serves fingerhutlawgroup.com. The new site (serving
# friedmanfingerhut.com + www) sees a non-matching Host and serves content
# normally. :splat preserves the path for in-flight links (critical for
# Supabase magic-link URLs under /kronos-invite/).

https://fingerhutlawgroup.com/*        https://friedmanfingerhut.com/:splat  301!
https://www.fingerhutlawgroup.com/*    https://friedmanfingerhut.com/:splat  301!
http://fingerhutlawgroup.com/*         https://friedmanfingerhut.com/:splat  301!
http://www.fingerhutlawgroup.com/*     https://friedmanfingerhut.com/:splat  301!
